    description: "Python, Go, Ruby, Java, Kotlin all have independent field-type resolution. Migrate them to populate FileAnalysis.class_field_types and use resolve_receiver_type() from the base class (PR #1729) for consistency. Not urgent -- existing implementations work -- but reduces code duplication long-term. Python uses class_field_types in py.py, Go uses _extract_go_var_types(), Ruby uses _extract_ruby_var_types()."  # d81a
