  message: "Deferring: P4 refactoring across 5 languages (Python, Go, Ruby, Java, Kotlin). Existing implementations work correctly. The base-class field type pattern is proven (C#, C++ use it). Migration would reduce ~200 lines of duplicated code but doesn't fix any bugs. Will tackle when working on those analyzers for other reasons."  # 170c
